The agents' workspace is the open-source ASPIRE v1.0 code base (https://github.com/NVlabs/ASPIRE, commit fa00f0e),
which launch/setup.sh fetches; it is not part of this repository. The following files of this repository are
modified copies of files from ASPIRE, which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  skeptic/overlay/artifacts.py        from src/cap_harness/artifacts.py: also stores an agentview depth image with
                                      each keyframe
  skeptic/overlay/subagent-prompt.md  from .claude/skills/iterative-debugging/subagent-prompt.md: one added entry
                                      on the observation timeline

launch/qwen_chat_template.jinja is a modified copy of the served model's chat template (see the model card for its
license): it maps the effort levels the agent runtime may send onto the levels the template accepts.

